#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:2 6a1207d7826544869ea10110819ce557
msgid "安装指南"
msgstr "Installation Guide"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:4 377453638a044d4eb503ac4a5a4b5ab6
msgid ""
"本页说明如何把 Godot-FmodPlayer 安装到 Godot 项目中，并补齐 FMOD Core API "
"运行库。推荐优先使用预编译版本；只有需要修改插件源码或自行适配平台时，才需要从源码构建。"
msgstr ""
"This page explains how to install Godot-FmodPlayer into a Godot project and add the required FMOD"
" Core API runtime libraries. In most cases, use the prebuilt package. Build from source only when"
" you need to modify the plugin source code or adapt it to another platform."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:8 15f37868255e4e6781862dceb1db3254
msgid "安装前确认"
msgstr "Before You Start"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:10 63de402c3d804a0db7c050a5a3d56e5c
msgid "开始前请确认："
msgstr "Before you begin, make sure that:"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:12 5f6f5e5bd742497389d30fd992ba9be9
msgid "Godot 版本为 4.7.2 或更高版本；当前编辑器 Dock 使用 4.7.2 的公开 API。"
msgstr "Godot 4.7.2 or newer; the editor Dock uses the public API from 4.7.2."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:13 ae82073ecad4489a8850d3e2f62934ca
msgid "目标平台目前为 Windows x86_64 或 Android arm64。"
msgstr "Your target platform is currently Windows x86_64 or Android arm64."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:14 09ad38e9ea804db585600bf83a0859cb
msgid "已准备好从 FMOD 官网下载 FMOD Engine。"
msgstr "You are ready to download FMOD Engine from the official FMOD website."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:18 b213cb1b5fa94b819e811b06fd02dcf1
msgid ""
"Godot-FmodPlayer 插件本身不包含 FMOD 运行库。由于 FMOD 的许可要求， 你需要自行从 `FMOD 下载页面 "
"<https://www.fmod.com/download>`_ 获取 FMOD Engine，并把对应平台的运行库复制到项目中。"
msgstr ""
"Godot-FmodPlayer does not include the FMOD runtime libraries. Because of FMOD licensing "
"requirements, you must download FMOD Engine yourself from the `FMOD download page "
"<https://www.fmod.com/download>`_ and copy the runtime libraries for your target platform into "
"the project."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:23 5d15ab00bebc4ed88dfbc145733cb215
msgid "预编译版本（推荐）"
msgstr "Prebuilt Package (Recommended)"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:26 95f2cb8da5b94baa9443c1b5182a5c75
msgid "下载插件"
msgstr "Download the Plugin"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:28 59483fe1f483458f888b5d6fb13c3d65
msgid ""
"从 `Godot Asset Library <https://godotengine.org/asset-library/asset/4905>`_ 下载插件，或从 `GitHub "
"Releases <https://github.com/LuYingYiLong/Godot-FmodPlayer/releases>`_ 下载发布包。"
msgstr ""
"Download the plugin from the `Godot Asset Library <https://godotengine.org/asset-"
"library/asset/4905>`_, or download a release package from `GitHub Releases "
"<https://github.com/LuYingYiLong/Godot-FmodPlayer/releases>`_."

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:32 e0df1a24e1374b238355133d2f76334c
msgid "解压后，将 ``addons/fmod_player`` 复制到你的 Godot 项目："
msgstr "After extracting the package, copy ``addons/fmod_player`` into your Godot project:"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:34 a721e1d1b3944d379a7b34a2903bbf67
msgid ""
"res://\n"
"└── addons/\n"
"    └── fmod_player/\n"
"        ├── plugin.cfg\n"
"        ├── fmod_check.gd\n"
"        ├── fmod_player_main.gd\n"
"        └── bin/\n"
"            ├── fmod_player.gdextension\n"
"            ├── fmod_player.windows.template_debug.x86_64.dll\n"
"            ├── fmod_player.windows.template_release.x86_64.dll\n"
"            ├── libfmod_player.android.template_debug.arm64.so\n"
"            └── libfmod_player.android.template_release.arm64.so"
msgstr ""
"res://\n"
"└── addons/\n"
"    └── fmod_player/\n"
"        ├── plugin.cfg\n"
"        ├── fmod_check.gd\n"
"        ├── fmod_player_main.gd\n"
"        └── bin/\n"
"            ├── fmod_player.gdextension\n"
"            ├── fmod_player.windows.template_debug.x86_64.dll\n"
"            ├── fmod_player.windows.template_release.x86_64.dll\n"
"            ├── libfmod_player.android.template_debug.arm64.so\n"
"            └── libfmod_player.android.template_release.arm64.so"

