#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:83 e5d30c6621cb4787aa87f29e78f5dbc9
msgid ""
"编辑器插件会在启用时检查 ``fmod.dll``、``libfmod.so`` 或 ``libfmod.dylib``。 如果没有找到 FMOD 运行库，Godot "
"会显示提示窗口，并引导你前往 FMOD 下载页面。"
msgstr ""
"When enabled, the editor plugin checks for ``fmod.dll``, ``libfmod.so``, or ``libfmod.dylib``. If"
" the FMOD runtime library cannot be found, Godot displays a prompt and points you to the FMOD "
"download page."

